// Baked visual assets for the deck themes — generated, not hand-written.
//
// 🔴 ICONS ONLY. The gradient art used to live here too, as three baked JPEGs. It does not any
// more: twenty themes would have meant sixty images, so backgrounds are PAINTED IN CODE now
// (see deck-art.ts) and this file is just the icon set.
//
// 🔴 THE ICONS ARE LUCIDE (ISC licence) — the icon set the product already ships in its UI —
// rasterised in two inks, one for light slides and one for dark. PNG rather than SVG because
// PowerPoint's SVG support is uneven across versions and Google Slides drops SVGs silently.
//
// 🔴 STILL HEAVY (~90KB) AND STILL LAZY-IMPORT-ONLY — see deck-pptx.ts, whose builder does a
// dynamic import of this file. A static import anywhere in the app shell would put every byte
// of this into the first page load.

